title: mf:watch-activity
tags: [[GUI command]] Watcher
kind: reference
summary: Start the active repository's watcher event counts over (mf watch activity --reset)

`mf:watch-activity reset` is the GUI half of `mf watch activity --reset`: the event
counts of the active repository start over from now ([[Watch activity]]). The
[[file manager|file-manager panel]] re-reads its counts at once; the metarecord detail
panel shows the new count the next time it loads a record.
